@* ManageLayout's <aside> nav block (Auth projects only) — the static-SSR Account/Manage area's
   own copy of the Sider's nav markup. There is no shared data model between this and AppSider
   (that was deliberately removed) — this block must be a LITERAL, independently-maintained copy.
   Whatever items/gating you apply to AppSider, apply the identical items/gating here too. *@

<aside class="ux-account-nav-drawer">
    <MudNavMenu>
        <MudNavLink Href="/" Match="NavLinkMatch.All" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Home">Home</MudNavLink>

        <MudNavLink Href="/product-list" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Inventory2">Product List</MudNavLink>

        <AuthorizeView Roles="Admin,Write">
            <Authorized>
                <MudNavLink Href="/order-list" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ListAlt">Order List</MudNavLink>
            </Authorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </MudNavMenu>
</aside>
